  "purpose": "Regional roots per lane leaf, meeting only at registered seams (r1 gate: one lane root of 32,978 sinks failed the measured >15k insertion/spread rule; s2 EARLY_FAIL_HOLD from per-stage roots): clk_pin pin registers, clk stages 0-3+5-7 (~13.1k), clk_sfu stage-4 SFU (~10.8k), clk_ins insertion line (~9.4k), clk_side SIDE pipe; seams = stage-3 registers -> SFU/insertion inputs and their outputs -> stage-5 merge. OT_QMUL4_INCUT, recipe 4 (hold_budget die), sync regional reset (relays sample on the pin root). KIND2 carries the SIDE pipe inside (no side pins), outline 248.4 x 432.",
